<title>FRANCE: Rouen June 1-4 flour exports at 31,500 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen June 1-4 flour exports at 31,500 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour exports from Rouen reached 31,500 tonnes between June 1 and June 4, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Flour exports for the whole of June 1996 were 80,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>June 1-4 exports included 3,000 tonnes to Algeria, 10,000 tonnes to Cuba and 18,500 tonnes to Yemen, they said. --Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
